# NO Git LFS. Deliberate.
#
# Claude Code's cloud sandbox proxy rejects the LFS batch API, so LFS-tracked
# files clone as ~130-byte pointer stubs (anthropics/claude-code#25043, recurring
# as #60593). A gate reading a stub instead of a 70 MB database does not crash -
# it reports zero rows, and a ratio over a zero denominator reports 100%. That is
# the silent-wrong-data failure this project exists to catch.
#
# Instead, the 315 MB of derived binaries live OUTSIDE the repository, are
# recorded in data-manifest.json with size and sha256, fetched by
# ci/fetch_data.sh, and verified by check40 (gate DATA1) before any gate that
# reads them. This works identically in every environment.
#
# Line endings and the executable bit still matter for the hooks.
.claude/hooks/*.sh     text eol=lf
ci/*.sh                text eol=lf
retrieval/run.sh       text eol=lf
.claude/skills/**/*.sh text eol=lf
*.py                   text eol=lf
